  VALUES
    ('ios_crash_gate', 'iOS crash gate', 'blocked', 'Authenticated App Store Connect confirms one iOS 1.0.1 crash on 2026-08-25, but privacy suppression exposes no device, OS, crash report, stack, or UUID. Product commit 24ea373 retains the reachable-path and fail-closed surface hardening, places the Best Time recommendation on the primary activation path, and passes the shared iOS simulator test, 18 Apple surface XCTest cases, and fresh app/widget/watch Release simulator builds. Those preventive results cannot be attributed to the historical event and do not replace symbolication, exact signed physical iPhone QA, or post-rollout evidence.', 'Obtain any diagnostic report Apple later exposes, symbolicate if available, run exact signed physical iPhone QA, and collect post-rollout evidence'),
    ('open_meteo_promotion_clearance', 'Open-Meteo promotion clearance', 'pass', 'The complete authenticated Gmail record was checked read-only on 2026-08-29. The 06:05:07 +05:00 request described Nimbo as free and non-monetized, with no subscriptions, advertising, paid features, affiliate links, accounts, analytics SDK, or sale of user data, and limited promotion to unpaid localized posts, one personalized contact plus at most one follow-up, genuine Apple/Google editorial submissions, and ordinary unpaid links. At 17:25 +05:00, Nicoletta Addimando via OpenMeteo GmbH replied in ticket 234272 and explicitly confirmed that under those terms Nimbo is entitled to use the non-commercial API. This pass is limited to that exact scope and the published Free API limits; monetization, paid promotion, attribution removal, limit changes, or other material facts require a new licensing decision.', 'Preserve the confirmed scope and reopen licensing review before any material monetization, promotion, attribution, endpoint, or usage-limit change'),
    ('release_artifact_source_sync', 'Release artifact source sync', 'blocked', 'Product commit 24ea373 resolves to Android phone 1.1.0 (8), Wear OS 1.1.0 (1000008), and Apple 1.1.0 (6). Phone AAB SHA-256 f91d0dce82aad7596118a6563d64b94f9f90daa2550cfb4b345fc3ef966bfdab and mapping SHA-256 d749110783872a36406c56a99b11d9c67764a7973d767656c3bd6f0ed59addfd pass Bundletool 1.18.3 and embedded-VCS checks but the AAB has 0 signature entries. Wear AAB SHA-256 6bcf5f9b947cb52887ba2e5c7a48c59cd5a1428c4680c67d63edd6a708bcd439 embeds 24ea373 and has 0 signature entries; the retained signed Wear AAB embeds historical revision 4d9492a. Apple simulator hashes are app 421b867257004a15e6042cb98817190570b91cb8c54ac61b3c4e8df049f94ad7, widget e639f0661cd6e96924803d8aa5982706ee0d78c981b7d2d4375b920d2eac1b27, and watch 9f29f22984185f2c5cf072357434b442b5e95f90b6c292b9aabfc97993bd689d; UUID-matched dSYMs verify, but these are ad-hoc simulator products, not archives. The exact debug phone APK passed the bounded physical API 25 activation-path smoke. Android protected lookup and Apple private-key use remain unavailable. There is no exact-current signed phone/Wear artifact, distribution-signed Apple archive, or signed-artifact physical matrix.', 'Restore private signing authorization without replacing the existing identities, then create exact-current signed phone vc8, Wear 1000008, and Apple build-6 artifacts, verify identities and hashes, and record exact physical QA'),
    ('android_physical_smoke', 'Android device smoke', 'blocked', 'Product commit 24ea373 exact debug APK SHA-256 968ac46930c6175562855b1e5229a74f9d49c47e3b4da107334d337291530ad4 passed a fresh-install physical Android 7.1.1 / API 25 smoke in Russian; pulled installed bytes matched. Onboarding, Tashkent without location permission, the first-screen Best Time card, 150% text, and the exercised process path passed. Prior commit ee7c36f retains API 24 phone-widget and API 37 round-Wear Empty/Fresh/Stale emulator evidence, but there is no exact-current upload-signed phone artifact, physical tablet/widget result, or paired Wear OS result. The current physical gate therefore remains blocked.', 'Sign and verify phone vc8, then run the exact signed artifact on phone and tablet plus widget and paired Wear OS paths'),
    ('ios_physical_smoke', 'iOS physical smoke', 'blocked', 'Product commit 24ea373 Apple 1.1.0 (6) Release simulator executable hashes are app 421b867257004a15e6042cb98817190570b91cb8c54ac61b3c4e8df049f94ad7, widget e639f0661cd6e96924803d8aa5982706ee0d78c981b7d2d4375b920d2eac1b27, and watch 9f29f22984185f2c5cf072357434b442b5e95f90b6c292b9aabfc97993bd689d. UUID-matched dSYMs, the shared iOS simulator test, and 18 surface XCTest cases pass, but all three products are simulator-only with ad-hoc linker signatures, no TeamIdentifier, no archive, and no upload eligibility. The iPad CoreDevice/DDI path is usable, but no exact-current signed build exists; iPhone, iPad, WidgetKit, and paired-watch physical coverage remains required.', 'Create and verify distribution-signed build 6, then run the exact artifact on iPhone and the now-usable iPad CoreDevice path plus widget and paired watch paths'),
    ('domain_activation', 'Domain activation', 'pass', 'At 2026-08-29 10:40–10:41 +05:00, authenticated GitHub Pages settings showed DNS check successful and Enforce HTTPS enabled. The Let''s Encrypt certificate has CN nimbo.uz, SANs nimbo.uz/www.nimbo.uz, and validates for both hosts. WHOIS, .uz delegation, authoritative Cloudflare records, and independent 1.1.1.1/8.8.8.8 resolution pass. HTTPS returns 200 with verification result 0 for all 12 published UZ-root/RU/EN landing, press, privacy, and support routes plus growth, robots, sitemap, and the valid metadata schema. HTTP apex redirects to HTTPS; HTTP www reaches HTTPS apex in two redirects; HTTPS www redirects directly to HTTPS apex. All 12 localized HTML routes have the expected HTTPS canonical and language. Uzbek intentionally uses ' || chr(47) || ' rather than a separate ' || chr(47) || 'uz' || chr(47) || ' route.', 'Maintain dated DNS, certificate, redirect, canonical, and localized-route verification at each release'),
    ('store_policy_console_clearance', 'Store policy console clearance', 'pass', 'The 2026-08-28 App Store read-only check found no open review/compliance action. Google Play reported no policy issues at 2026-08-29 13:12 +05:00; production remained active at 1.0.2 (6), 100%. At 13:59:40 +05:00, UZ Custom Store Listing 4834799756935529888 was saved only as Draft, not submitted for review or published; Publishing overview still showed the latest publication on 2026-08-27. This is point-in-time Console evidence, not a guarantee against later review. See growth/quality/store-policy-console-2026-08-28.md and growth/quality/google-play-console-2026-08-29.md.', 'Re-check both app-global store policy surfaces at the next evidence cutoff')
) AS gates(gate_id, gate, status, evidence, next_action);
